---
// Hero section matching brightideagroup.com
---

<section id="hero" class="relative bg-[#091325] text-white overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background Video with Poster Fallback -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 overflow-hidden">
    <video
      autoplay
      muted
      loop
      playsinline
      poster="/assets/images/hero-poster.webp"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
    >
      <source
        src="/assets/video/hero-lightbulbs.mp4"
        type="video/mp4"
      />
    </video>
    <!-- Scrim Overlay: rgba(0, 19, 53, 0.75) -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#001335]/75"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Content -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 min-h-[580px] flex flex-col justify-center items-start text-left">
    <div class="max-w-[860px]">
      <h1 class="leading-[1.25] md:leading-[61.6px] font-bold font-serif text-white mb-6 text-[44px]">
        Scale Your Law Firms Growth with Bright Ideas
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal text-white/90 max-w-[720px] mb-8">
        Stay Ahead Of Your Competitors! Most small to mid-size law firms are fed strategies that don't work for them. We can help forge a path to bright ideas that are unique to you, work for you &amp; drive results for you.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/services"
          class="bg-[#22427D] hover:bg-[#1b3564] text-white text-[18px] font-normal px-6 py-3 rounded-[4px] transition-colors shadow-md text-center"
        >
          Explore Our Services
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="bg-[#3AA6C4] hover:bg-[#318ca5] text-white text-[18px] font-normal px-6 py-3 rounded-[4px] transition-colors shadow-md text-center"
        >
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
